# Las Vegas Strip — what stays out of the public repository (audit: docs/OPEN-SOURCE.md).

# The Bitmagic engine and the skills the CLI ships are not part of this repository: they are a dependency that
# `bitmagic upgrade` installs (Bitmagic Pro login needed; README.md). To commit a skill of our own, add
# `!.agents/skills/<name>/` and `!.claude/skills/<name>/` below these lines.
engine/
.agents/skills/
.claude/skills/

# Bitmagic CLI defaults
dist/
node_modules/
.bitmagic/
.vite-cache/

# Built runtime assets and pipeline intermediates (about 29 GB). The runtime subset ships as the
# asset pack: `node tools/release/fetch-assets.mjs` (docs/ASSETS.md).
build/

# Local machine state, caches and logs
.DS_Store
**/.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
tools/film/log/
.claude/settings.local.json
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
.npmrc

# Dated journals quote private conversations with the owner: they stay local. Third-party research media:
# viewed for reference, never redistributed. The source URLs stay in
# the committed JSON/Markdown records; the images, PDFs and screenshots do not.
docs/project-records/journal-*.md
docs/project-records/archive/
docs/project-records/user-references/
docs/project-records/index-history/
docs/project-records/**/*.png
docs/project-records/**/*.jpg
docs/project-records/**/*.jpeg
docs/project-records/**/*.webp
docs/project-records/**/*.gif
docs/project-records/**/*.pdf
docs/project-records/**/*.mp4
docs/project-records/**/*.mov
docs/project-records/**/*.glb
docs/project-records/**/*.blend
**/references/**/*.png
**/references/**/*.jpg
**/references/**/*.jpeg
**/references/**/*.webp
**/references/**/*.gif
**/references/**/*.pdf
**/references/**/*.heic
tools/resort-blocks/references/**/*.png
tools/resort-blocks/references/**/*.pdf

# Not ours to redistribute, or rebuilt locally
tools/info-video/fonts/
tools/uthana/adapter/
tools/optimize/bm-tools/
tools/foliage/sources/
